SUMMARY:KONZERT // Frankie &amp; Yamirah
DESCRIPTION:Frankie  &amp; Yamirah \nBerlin-based singer and songwriter Frankie Balou has been making music since her teens, releasing her first record with Frankfurt label 3p and reaching the German charts. Rooted in Soul and deep Blues, her warm, distinctive voice moves between unreleased original songs and a selection of her favorite covers.\nShe is joined by Berlin-based guitarist Yamirah Gercke, a Berklee College of Music graduate whose atmospheric playing blends Jazz, Soul and psychedelic sounds.\nThe two first met by chance one summer day, when Yamirah was playing her floating guitar on the street below Frankie’s window. That spontaneous encounter grew into a musical connection, bringing their two distinct musical backgrounds together.\nExpect an intimate and powerful night full of groove, emotion and, above all, Soul.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/frankie_balou_official/?hl=en\nhttps://www.instagram.com/yamirahguitar/?hl=en\nEINTRITT FREI || DIE MONEYBOX GEHT RUM\nBezahlvorschlag: Das Doppelte eures Getränks\n \n
URL:https://kallasch.berlin/programm/konzert-11-884-335-104-264-632-432-775/
CATEGORIES:KONZERT
LOCATION:Kallasch&amp; // Unionstr. 2, 10551
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://kallasch.berlin/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Red-Bold-Modern-Music-Concert-Event-Poster-4.png
END:VEVENT
